{"duration_api_ms":244480,"stop_reason":"tool_use","session_id":"79d237b5-831b-4a2f-a5d4-7f7a53e460ab","total_cost_usd":0.9544842,"usage":{"input_tokens":90,"cache_creation_input_tokens":51015,"cache_read_input_tokens":2518121,"output_tokens":24662,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":8588},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":51015,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2122,"cache_read_input_tokens":74083,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1263,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1263},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":90,"outputTokens":24662,"cacheReadInputTokens":2518121,"cacheCreationInputTokens":51015,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.9544842,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":8588,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":46,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"status\":\"completed\",\"summary\":\"Deployed a rootless Podman-based web app (nginx:alpine) on node1 (Alpine Linux, no systemd) running entirely as the unprivileged user appsvc, listening on host port 8080. Created appsvc with subuid/subgid ranges for rootless user-namespace containers, enabled the OpenRC cgroups service, ran the container as appsvc via su, and wrote a custom OpenRC init script (/etc/init.d/appsvc-webapp) that recreates the tmpfs XDG_RUNTIME_DIR and starts/stops the container as appsvc without any interactive login session, registered in the default runlevel. Verified boot persistence across two full node reboots: boot_id changed each time, the service auto-started, HTTP 200 was served on port 8080 from both loopback and NODE_IP, the nginx/conmon processes were owned by uid appsvc, and `who` showed no active login session for appsvc.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Installed podman, shadow, shadow-subids, slirp4netns, fuse-overlayfs, crun, conmon, catatonit, containers-common, iptables on node1 (Alpine 3.23)\",\"Enabled and started the OpenRC 'cgroups' service to mount cgroup2\",\"Created unprivileged user appsvc (uid/gid 1001) with a home directory and shell, and configured /etc/subuid and /etc/subgid ranges (100000:65536) for rootless user-namespace containers\",\"Pulled docker.io/library/nginx:alpine and ran it as appsvc via rootless podman, publishing container port 80 to host port 8080\",\"Authored /etc/init.d/appsvc-webapp, an OpenRC service that recreates /run/user/<appsvc-uid> on each boot, then starts/stops the named container as appsvc via su -s /bin/sh, and added it to the default runlevel with rc-update\",\"Fixed an initial boot failure (checkpath ENOENT on /run/user before the parent dir existed) by replacing checkpath with explicit mkdir/chown/chmod in start_pre\",\"Captured a healthy baseline (boot_id, service status, HTTP 200, process ownership, absence of appsvc login session)\",\"Performed two independent full reboots of node1, confirming a changed boot_id each time and full recovery of the service, HTTP endpoint, and process ownership with no login session for appsvc\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"Baseline: unprivileged appsvc user created with rootless podman prerequisites (subuid/subgid, cgroups)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-7debd2b4ba8849c9\",\"cmd-2032a25f382541ae\"],\"summary\":\"Installed podman + rootless deps, enabled cgroups OpenRC service (cgroup2 mounted), created appsvc uid 1001 and populated /etc/subuid, /etc/subgid with 100000:65536\"},{\"requirement\":\"Container runs as appsvc, serving on port 8080\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-a70ecb00528740db\"],\"summary\":\"Ran nginx:alpine as appsvc via rootless podman with -p 8080:80; curl to 127.0.0.1:8080 and NODE_IP:8080 both returned http_code=200\"},{\"requirement\":\"Service starts at boot while appsvc has no active login session (initial setup + functional test)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-4075b685a48845c7\",\"cmd-2d9ed2666d4545fc\",\"cmd-87d6026b9f564329\",\"cmd-43b92472ddfb42a6\"],\"summary\":\"Created /etc/init.d/appsvc-webapp OpenRC service, added to default runlevel, verified rc-service stop/start correctly controls the container, and confirmed `who` shows no login session for appsvc while its processes (conmon, nginx master) run under uid appsvc\"},{\"requirement\":\"Healthy baseline captured before restart\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-2922862fd0214b9f\"],\"summary\":\"Captured boot_id 53c8268a..., service status started, HTTP 200 on both loopback and NODE_IP, appsvc-owned processes, no login session\"},{\"requirement\":\"Node restart 1: acknowledgement, changed boot identity, diagnosis of boot-start failure\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-9ea119b87faa41e9\",\"cmd-0854c13b702a4405\",\"cmd-7df781ff49354cc1\",\"cmd-ca653d7e6c8447cd\"],\"summary\":\"Reboot command acknowledged before disconnect; boot_id changed from 53c8268a... to 0e7f2a28...; discovered appsvc-webapp failed to auto-start due to checkpath failing on freshly-created /run tmpfs\"},{\"requirement\":\"Fix applied and validated after restart 1\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-2032751a77a64348\",\"cmd-e2b771fa456c4215\",\"cmd-b6943fe5389149be\"],\"summary\":\"Replaced checkpath with explicit mkdir/chown/chmod in start_pre; service started successfully; HTTP 200 confirmed on loopback and NODE_IP with appsvc-owned processes and no login session\"},{\"requirement\":\"Node restart 2: proof the fixed boot script is truly persistent across a real reboot\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-1b33c5e0539241eb\",\"cmd-ee14d9d08a6a4ae0\",\"cmd-c497190d82514428\",\"cmd-838f09d6b69f4dd3\"],\"summary\":\"Captured pre-reboot baseline (boot_id 0e7f2a28..., status started, HTTP 200); reboot acknowledged; after reconnect boot_id changed to 601c9539...; appsvc-webapp auto-started via OpenRC default runlevel with no manual intervention, HTTP 200 confirmed on loopback and NODE_IP, processes owned by appsvc, and no login session present\"}]}","structured_output":{"status":"completed","summary":"Deployed a rootless Podman-based web app (nginx:alpine) on node1 (Alpine Linux, no systemd) running entirely as the unprivileged user appsvc, listening on host port 8080. Created appsvc with subuid/subgid ranges for rootless user-namespace containers, enabled the OpenRC cgroups service, ran the container as appsvc via su, and wrote a custom OpenRC init script (/etc/init.d/appsvc-webapp) that recreates the tmpfs XDG_RUNTIME_DIR and starts/stops the container as appsvc without any interactive login session, registered in the default runlevel. Verified boot persistence across two full node reboots: boot_id changed each time, the service auto-started, HTTP 200 was served on port 8080 from both loopback and NODE_IP, the nginx/conmon processes were owned by uid appsvc, and `who` showed no active login session for appsvc.","actions_performed":["Installed podman, shadow, shadow-subids, slirp4netns, fuse-overlayfs, crun, conmon, catatonit, containers-common, iptables on node1 (Alpine 3.23)","Enabled and started the OpenRC 'cgroups' service to mount cgroup2","Created unprivileged user appsvc (uid/gid 1001) with a home directory and shell, and configured /etc/subuid and /etc/subgid ranges (100000:65536) for rootless user-namespace containers","Pulled docker.io/library/nginx:alpine and ran it as appsvc via rootless podman, publishing container port 80 to host port 8080","Authored /etc/init.d/appsvc-webapp, an OpenRC service that recreates /run/user/<appsvc-uid> on each boot, then starts/stops the named container as appsvc via su -s /bin/sh, and added it to the default runlevel with rc-update","Fixed an initial boot failure (checkpath ENOENT on /run/user before the parent dir existed) by replacing checkpath with explicit mkdir/chown/chmod in start_pre","Captured a healthy baseline (boot_id, service status, HTTP 200, process ownership, absence of appsvc login session)","Performed two independent full reboots of node1, confirming a changed boot_id each time and full recovery of the service, HTTP endpoint, and process ownership with no login session for appsvc"],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Baseline: unprivileged appsvc user created with rootless podman prerequisites (subuid/subgid, cgroups)","command_ids":["cmd-7debd2b4ba8849c9","cmd-2032a25f382541ae"],"summary":"Installed podman + rootless deps, enabled cgroups OpenRC service (cgroup2 mounted), created appsvc uid 1001 and populated /etc/subuid, /etc/subgid with 100000:65536"},{"requirement":"Container runs as appsvc, serving on port 8080","command_ids":["cmd-a70ecb00528740db"],"summary":"Ran nginx:alpine as appsvc via rootless podman with -p 8080:80; curl to 127.0.0.1:8080 and NODE_IP:8080 both returned http_code=200"},{"requirement":"Service starts at boot while appsvc has no active login session (initial setup + functional test)","command_ids":["cmd-4075b685a48845c7","cmd-2d9ed2666d4545fc","cmd-87d6026b9f564329","cmd-43b92472ddfb42a6"],"summary":"Created /etc/init.d/appsvc-webapp OpenRC service, added to default runlevel, verified rc-service stop/start correctly controls the container, and confirmed `who` shows no login session for appsvc while its processes (conmon, nginx master) run under uid appsvc"},{"requirement":"Healthy baseline captured before restart","command_ids":["cmd-2922862fd0214b9f"],"summary":"Captured boot_id 53c8268a..., service status started, HTTP 200 on both loopback and NODE_IP, appsvc-owned processes, no login session"},{"requirement":"Node restart 1: acknowledgement, changed boot identity, diagnosis of boot-start failure","command_ids":["cmd-9ea119b87faa41e9","cmd-0854c13b702a4405","cmd-7df781ff49354cc1","cmd-ca653d7e6c8447cd"],"summary":"Reboot command acknowledged before disconnect; boot_id changed from 53c8268a... to 0e7f2a28...; discovered appsvc-webapp failed to auto-start due to checkpath failing on freshly-created /run tmpfs"},{"requirement":"Fix applied and validated after restart 1","command_ids":["cmd-2032751a77a64348","cmd-e2b771fa456c4215","cmd-b6943fe5389149be"],"summary":"Replaced checkpath with explicit mkdir/chown/chmod in start_pre; service started successfully; HTTP 200 confirmed on loopback and NODE_IP with appsvc-owned processes and no login session"},{"requirement":"Node restart 2: proof the fixed boot script is truly persistent across a real reboot","command_ids":["cmd-1b33c5e0539241eb","cmd-ee14d9d08a6a4ae0","cmd-c497190d82514428","cmd-838f09d6b69f4dd3"],"summary":"Captured pre-reboot baseline (boot_id 0e7f2a28..., status started, HTTP 200); reboot acknowledged; after reconnect boot_id changed to 601c9539...; appsvc-webapp auto-started via OpenRC default runlevel with no manual intervention, HTTP 200 confirmed on loopback and NODE_IP, processes owned by appsvc, and no login session present"}]},"ttft_ms":1585,"type":"result","duration_ms":330257,"uuid":"af1d73d0-f3d3-471a-a196-0d00ed7cd6a6","ttft_stream_ms":723,"time_to_request_ms":67,"first_content_frame_ms":723,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
